            "sid": "2CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo Solomoni yamazire eikora lya Rwensinga y'Omukama. Aho akwata efeza, ezahabu n'ebikwato byona ebyo Daudi ishe yasigire ahongire abiteka omu sitoa za Rwensinga ya Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomoni ahuruza abagurusi ba Isiraeli, abakuru bona b'enganda n'abakuru b'amahiga ab'eihanga lya Isiraeli, baija Yerusalemu, baihya Esanduku y'Omukama y'Endagano omuli Sioni Ekigo kya Daudi bagitwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kikuru eky'omwezi gwa mushanju, embaga yona ya Isiraeli ehurura egoba Omukama Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagurusi bona ba Isiraeli baija n'Abalevita betweka Esanduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuhani n'Abalevita batwara Esanduku, Eihema ly'Omuterano n'ebikwato bitakatifu byona ebyabaire bili mw'Ihema elyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Solomoni n'enteko yona ya Isiraeli eyabaire emugobire bagya omu maisho g'Esanduku batamba entaama n'ente zingi muno obutabarwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo abakuhani baleta Esanduku y'Endagano y'Omukama omu mwanya gwayo, bagiteka Rwensinga aha kweru, bagiketera ahansi y'amapapa g'abakerubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakerubi bakaba bashanshurwire amapapa gabo mbali Esanduku yabaire eli, nikwo kugir'oti abakerubi bakaba bashwekire Esanduku n'emigamba yayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emigamba ekaba eli mirai mirai etyo, nangu omuntu tiyakwemire heru akabona mbali elekeleire, shana kayakugiire Ahatakatifu akema aha kweru. Emigamba egyo ekyabayo na mambwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu Sanduku hakaba hatalimu kantu shana embengo ibili ezo Musa yateleiremu Horebu, mbali Omukama yakoleire endagano n'eihanga lya Isiraeli orwo babaire nibaruga Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
